<item><title>Moulay Rachid presides over Marrakech festival opening dinner</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/moulay-rachid-presides-over-marrakech-festival-opening-ac081a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/moulay-rachid-presides-over-marrakech-festival-opening-ac081a/</guid><category>Morocco</category><description>The prince, who leads the festival foundation, joined a dinner hosted by King Mohammed VI as the 23rd edition began.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 23:34:42 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" length="33258" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Morocco meets Ghana in Amputee Football World Cup final</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-meets-ghana-in-amputee-football-world-cup-final-b76e8b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-meets-ghana-in-amputee-football-world-cup-final-b76e8b/</guid><category>Morocco</category><description>Morocco reached its first final by beating Brazil 2-1, overturning a one-goal deficit in a match decided late in the tournament.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 23:02:38 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" length="33258" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Spain sends Morocco 170 files to return unaccompanied minors from Ceuta</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/spain-sends-morocco-170-files-to-return-unaccompanied-4f031e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/spain-sends-morocco-170-files-to-return-unaccompanied-4f031e/</guid><category>Morocco</category><description>Spanish police say the families of the children have been identified and have agreed to their return, but Rabat has not responded to any of the files.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 20:04:46 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/spain-sends-morocco-170-files-to-return-unaccompanied-4f031e/share.jpg" length="41526" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/spain-sends-morocco-170-files-to-return-unaccompanied-4f031e/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Morocco wins four places on CAF committees, including a chairmanship</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-wins-four-places-on-caf-committees-including-a-838879/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/morocco-wins-four-places-on-caf-committees-including-a-838879/</guid><category>Morocco</category><description>CAF approved the appointments at its assembly in Abuja, while Fouzi Lekjaa left the finance committee and kept his first vice-president role.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 14:33:49 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" length="33258" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>FIFA to inspect six Moroccan cities for 2030 World Cup preparations</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/fifa-to-inspect-six-moroccan-cities-for-2030-world-cup-4abc72/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ma/fifa-to-inspect-six-moroccan-cities-for-2030-world-cup-4abc72/</guid><category>Morocco</category><description>The delegation will assess sports infrastructure, transport networks and accommodation capacity as Morocco prepares to co-host the tournament with Spain and Portugal.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:49:20 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" length="33258" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ma.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
